{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39587","headline":"对雨述怀示弟承检 · 翁承赞","name":"对雨述怀示弟承检","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淋淋霎霎结秋霖，欲使秦城叹陆沈。\n晓势遮回朝客马，夜声滴破旅人心。\n青苔重叠封颜巷，白发萧疎引越吟。\n不有惠连同此景，江南归思几般深。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"翁承赞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39587.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39587","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}